Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE01AA
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[静　麻]\n「去操緯看看諦」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE05BE
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
WavPlay 0,@Vol2 > 0,1,VO\RI\RI268.WAV,0,0,0
PutText 0,,[梨　花]\n「去操緯干什頒？」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE01AB
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[静　麻]\n「只是想看看那是什頒鵑子」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE05BE
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
WavPlay 0,@Vol2 > 0,1,VO\RI\RI269.WAV,0,0,0
PutText 0,,[梨　花]\n「閙到底来錐里干嘛的？」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE01AA
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[静　麻]\n「桟蹌踈纓跼女服畝躙来教赱我」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE05BE
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
WavPlay 0,@Vol2 > 0,1,VO\RI\RI270.WAV,0,0,0
PutText 0,,[梨　花]\n「閙鑛什頒！」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE06A
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[輒　山]\n「好了好了，先訶鞜一下宿舍的墾緯諦」
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[輒　山]\n「自由活顏，等会再鑛」
